  <History Date="13-02-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  contains range conflicts.  white fx ranges not documented properly and don't make sense - made best guess.  similarly DMX+Net ArtNet part not documented properly and doesn't make sense.  assumed should be 116 channels.  no pixel layout)" Version="0" />
